e routing design investigation's recommended configuration surface.\n45\t- Ensure the operator's rendering of the main tracking deployment can set this configuration.\n46\t- Preserve current tracking server behavior when delegation is not configured.\n47\t\n48\t## Acceptance Criteria\n49\t\n50\t- The tracking server can be configured to delegate artifact operations to the dedicated artifacts-only instance, per the investigation's recommended configuration surface.\n51\t- With delegation configured, artifact operations on the main tracking deployment are directed to the dedicated artifacts-only instance.\n52\t- Without delegation configured, the tracking server's artifact serving behavior is unchanged.\n53\t\n54\t## HLR Traceability\n55\t\n56\t- [P1] Main tracking deployment routes artifact traffic to the dedicated artifacts-only instance (server-side portion, conditional on the routing-design outcome).\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc762b36544567a2","agent_id":"a4b47c329fafc8d7d","session_id":"52e2d593-99fe-4673-8bf8-9749f85fbc69","uuid":"27ffdfba-a860-411a-aa00-efcdf0a30e6e","timestamp":"2026-10-23T16:21:35.472Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bfd54d6e8e300292","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8009 decomposition"}
